WEBVTT

00:04:27.829 --> 00:04:31.538
It's the annual survey of the industry's
most liked screenplays.

00:04:31.538 --> 00:04:33.954
It's the partnered list
that we do with GLADD,

00:04:35.038 --> 00:04:39.204
IMPAC and other sort of affinity groups,
you know, for the Muslim community,

00:04:39.204 --> 00:04:41.204
the Asian Pacific Islander community, etc.
,

00:04:41.538 --> 00:04:45.996
all the way up to and including making
some of those scripts and movies.

00:04:46.038 --> 00:04:48.163
So we're producing a lot
of these things now.

00:04:48.496 --> 00:04:53.413
It's more about how can we be supportive
of the Hollywood community at large

00:04:53.579 --> 00:04:55.788
and especially screenwriters within it.

00:04:55.788 --> 00:04:59.996
And I think that that as a general guide
would sort of be the guiding principle

00:04:59.996 --> 00:05:01.163
for for everything we do.